meta {
  name: Inventaire (comptage absolu, PIN requis)
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/api/ingredients/{{created_restock_ingredient_id}}/inventory
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
}

body {
  {
    "actual_quantity": 42,
    "note": "comptage demo",
    "pin_email": "{{pin_email}}",
    "pin": "{{pin}}"
  }
}

docs {
stock.count + PIN (mlt 9.2). Pas d'audit_log au succes (stock_movement suffit).
}
